<title>UK: LB Rheinland-Pfalz set 100 mln SFR structured bond.</title>
<headline>LB Rheinland-Pfalz set 100 mln SFR structured bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESBANK RHEINLAND-PFALZ</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN SFR   COUPON     *5.00     MATURITY    07.MAY.07</p>
<p> TYPE   FIX/REV FRN   ISS PRICE  102.375   PAY DATE    07.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.75	REOFFER    PAR	 DENOMS (K)  FIVE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    SWISS     MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC   2.375</p>
<p> LISTING    EBS</p>
<p> NOTES     *FOR FIRST FIVE YEARS THEN 10.0 PCT MINUS (2X 6ML)</p>
<p>London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
